  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>內容：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">結構：</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong> 僅在沙漠中新增一個建築。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">該建築內含一個封印方塊</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">：手持圖騰右鍵點擊即可召喚Boss。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"font-size:18px\">Boss技能：</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-衝刺</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-側移衝刺</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-能量爆發（類似爆炸擊退玩家）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-旋轉攻擊</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/fthG1isQBf4?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
